<title>UK: Daiwa prices 100 million mark Turkey-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Daiwa prices 100 million mark Turkey-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Daiwa said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKISH SOVEREIGN REPACKAGED NOTES</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    26.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.575   PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.625     REOFFER    98.95     SPREAD	+355 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.375     LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND DUE JUNE 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
